From: Varun-iiitb <var3907@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 18:46:18 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 08/51] Add liveness controller and page tests

test/liveness/ (flutter test test/liveness: 44 tests):
- liveness_controller_test.dart (35): every event type; guidance debounce
  (waiting, latest wins, same hint no flicker) and clearing; every guidance
  and challenge key and icon; progress and "Please continue";
  LOOK_AT_CAMERA after a turn; attempts and Retry visibility; tips only for
  LIVENESS_NOT_VERIFIED; PAD and engine errors generic; device errors
  recoverable or not; FAILED_FINAL texts for each workflow; final PAD;
  operator cooldown refusal; permission refused; a result without
  FAILED_FINAL; bridge failure; CANCELLED; events after a final state; and
  every liveness key of app_en.arb resolving through livenessText. A manual
  timer factory drives the 500 ms debounce (fake_async is not a direct dev
  dependency).
- liveness_page_test.dart (9): a scripted LivenessService and a placeholder
  preview on a phone-sized surface: PASS_ACTIVE banner texts in order, then
  the page pops passed after about 1 s; PAD attack generic text without
  tips, then max attempts with the resident recovery text and Close;
  LIVENESS_NOT_VERIFIED tips and Retry -> retry(); Cancel -> cancel() and
  cancelled; back mid-session cancels; a CANCELLED result pops cancelled;
  disabled workflow pops disabled without starting; permission refused:
  device text, operator recovery, Close; guidance in the hint line and a
  result of another session ignored.

